 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $12.0B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +24.2% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was $4.0B in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was +8.9% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2023 was +9.0% [5] [6].\nRevenue growth in FY2024 was +11.7% [4] [7].\nEPS (basic) was $15.46 per share in FY2025 [8].\n\n## Margins\nOperating margin was 34.8% in FY2025 [9].\nNet margin was 32.9% in FY2025 [10].\nOperating margin changed +36.9pp in FY2025 [9] [11].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2025, free cash flow of $3.2B [12] was below net income of $4.0B [3].\nThe current ratio was 2.90\u00d7 in FY2025 [13], above 1.00\u00d7.\nCash & equivalents was $5.1B in FY2025 [14].\n\n## Red flags\nNo trend flags detected in the selected data.\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from +8.9% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how operating margin in the next reporting update compares with 34.8% in FY2025 [9].\nWatch how free cash flow in the next reporting update compares with $3.2B in FY2025 [12].",
